window.products.push({"id":828094,"name":"Foody Pack of 04 - Premium Stainless Steel Taco Holders - Taco Tray, Taco Serving Stand for upto 03 Tacos, Oven, Grill and dishwasher Safe Taco Racks ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WafyKdLwL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"TACOS are one of the most popular street foods in USA. Tacos are interestingly wrapped, stuffed and offer you a meal that you will love. People usually fall in love with tacos because they are tasty and different from generic food that is bland and boring. TACOS are great for friends or family gatherings dinners and parties at any time of the year. With so many taco styles choices and fillings, you can never run out of ideas for Taco night. Give your TACO nights a special restaurant touch with FOODY's metal taco stand. Available as set of 2 metal taco holders, with user friendly sleek and stylish design. Designed with love and crafted with care our stainless steel taco plates provides you and your guests with a hiend taco dining experience. We are confident that Foody's taco holder is best accessory that you need to make and serve the perfect tacos in style! Spill Free Design It's curved design is ideal for protecting the taco filling. Taco shells have a tricky shape and so the delicious filling always ends on the plate. Our stainless steel stand up taco holders will keep your tacos upright while you fill them, grill them, bake them in the oven, and finally serve them. This is your all in one taco partner to arrange funfilled taco Tuesdays. These taco platter be used for both soft shell and hard shell tacos. You may even use these for for fajitas, and also other wonderful delights such as sandwiches, tortillas, burritos, hotdogs in buns, waffles, patties, sandwiches and more. Perfect Gift Idea Show your love to your taco lover family and friends by gifting them with this perfect taco making and serving platter set. This will be the most useful gift for the people who like to throw parties. Anyone who loves tacos will appreciate having their very own taco trays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WafyKdLwL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foody","source_asin":"B08HCQY892","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCQY892","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCQY892","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":828095,"name":"Tuxedo Cookie Cutter 4 Inch - Hand Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418qRVNkmCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tuxedo cookie cutter hand-made of durable plastic. Hand wash, towel dry. Size: 2\" left to right and 4\" up and down. Color may vary. Made in the USA Our Cookie Cutters are manufactured in the United States with certified food-safe materials. Our cookie cutters designed specifically for making great cookies. Our original shapes feature rolled edges that make it easy to grip without hurting your hands and sharp bottom for precise cutting and remarkable results. We have been making cookie cutters right here in Pleasant Valley, Missouri since 2016! Family-owned and operated with good old fashion business values. We offer quality products, fast shipping, and great customer service! Reach out to us anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418qRVNkmCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CookieCutterCom","source_asin":"B00U7UQANY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U7UQANY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U7UQANY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
