window.products.push({"id":828361,"name":"Kitchen Lux 16oz Beer Glasses, Craft Beer Glasses Set of 6 Pint Glass. Beer Mug, IPA Beer Glass, Pint Glasses, Pub Pint Glass, Beer Cup, Beer Pint Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nc7kCGDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CRACK OPEN A COLD ONE, SERVE IT IN ONE OF THE KITCHEN LUX PILSNER BEER GLASSES AND THERE YOU HAVE IT – THE AUTHENTIC PUB EXPERIENCE AT HOME!Any serious beer drinker knows that the size and shape of their beer glass can make all the difference to their beer-drinking experience.Your beer’s flavor, carbonation, color and aroma, are all significantly improved when served right. CLASSIC PILSNER BEER GLASS SET – THE TIMELESS BEER GLASSES YOU NEED FOR AN ELEVATED BEER-DRINKING ROUTINE, EVERY SINGLE TIME.Inspired by the shape, size and performance of authentic pub glasses, these Pilsner beer cups feature the perfect size [16oz] and rim diameter [2.75 inches] for smooth, perfectly balanced sips.The slightly thick, rolled rim also ensures that the glass feels great the moment it touches your lips for that rewarding, cold and refreshing first taste. Plus, the weighted bottom of your new beer glasses guarantees a secure hold and prevents them from tipping over or any annoyances. BPA-FREE. LARGE. MINIMAL. VERSATILE. EVERYTHING YOU NEED FROM YOUR BEER GLASSES AND MORE.Thanks to their ultra-strong quality glass, these craft beer glasses are: * 100% BPA-Free and Lead-Free* Dishwasher Safe* Fridge & Freezer Safe* Ideal For Home & Professional UseTheir large and minimal design also works perfect with any type of beer including:- IPA - LAGER - PILSNER - CRAFT - ALE - HOMEMADE BEERS Great also for any other cold drink, including iced lattes, smoothies, beverages, iced tea and cocktails.THE BEST BEER GIFT FOR MEN THAT YOU CAN’T GO WRONG WITH!From your brother and father, to your boyfriend and husband or even your colleagues and your boss, one thing is certain: they will all love receiving such a handy beer gift. And that’s a fact. IT’S TIME TO REPLACE THOSE OLD AND CLOUDY BEER CUPS… ORDER YOURS TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nc7kCGDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Lux","source_asin":"B0B8QD3F8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8QD3F8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8QD3F8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
