window.products.push({"id":828464,"name":"3D Mosaic Frosted Decorative Textured Stained Glass Self Adhesive Privacy Window Film for Bathroom, Kitchen, Home, Office E0100A (17.90 inches x 6.5 f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x+xZYN0iL._AC_.jpg","description":"This durable, scratch-resistant film convincingly replicates the look of stained, cut glass, without the expense. It provides privacy, and keeps your valuable possessions out of sight, deterring burglars. Great for all windows, including showers, bathroom, cabinets, etc. Anyone can apply this easily, in just a few minutes. Can be easily removed without mess or damage. Possibly the quickest, most cost-effective way to redecorate your home. Installation Steps: 1) Cut film to window size with about 2cm added to width and height. 2) Clean window surface with glass cleaning product of choice. 3) Spray window with soapy/water solution; You should be able to easily slide the film along the glass without it sticking and may need to experiment with the amount of soap you add to the solution for your preferred level of grip. 4) Peel the film from a corner, exposing the self-adhesive backing. 5) Begin to apply film to the window surface from the top corner at either side and use a hand squeegee to push liquid solution and any air bubbles out. Work from side to side for best results. 6) Use an exact'o knife or other precision cutting blade to trim the excess material around the edge when complete.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x+xZYN0iL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VViViD","source_asin":"B018CW4SEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018CW4SEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018CW4SEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":828465,"name":"Cuilvu Cotton Candy Machine Commercial 1000W Cotton Candy Maker Mobile Cart,Candy Floss Machine for Business and Party,20.5 Inch,110V,Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vW3YYuJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【COMMERCIAL HIGH QUALITY】The quality is guaranteed, whether for commercial use or at home.The 20.5-inch food-grade stainless steel bowl is suitable for making cotton candy of various sizes. With a high power of 1000W and 30W electric motor, the aluminum candy outlet can still be heated evenly, and there will be no overheating that affects the production of cotton candy.After-sales:You will get worry-free 18-month warranty and lifelong technical guidance. 【NIMBLE AND STABLE】Whether you are selling cotton candy on the road or making them at home, the enlarged 15-inch wheels and chrome handle make this portable cotton candy machine easy to transport and operate. The sturdy steel frame construction and two work platforms and non-slip feet on the bottom of the machine add more stability, preventing the cotton candy machine from vibrating on uneven roads. 【SIMPLE OPERATION】Suitable for professional sellers and novices.In just a few easy steps, you can make sweet cotton candy: First,when you are ready to make cotton candy, just turn on the power button, then turn the temperature adjustment knob and let it warm up for 2 minutes. Second,use the included spoon to pour the sugar or hard candy into the plate,and after 12s you will get a cloud of cotton candy! 【EASY TO MAINTAIN】The cotton candy machine is easy to disassemble and install, the surface of the machine is smooth, not easy to leave stains, and it is more convenient to clean it after use.(NOTE: Before making,First adjust the temperature knob until the voltmeter shows 110V for preheating, and then adjust to 100V for production; And Long-term operation will cause overheating and damage to the machine.Any questions, please contact us in time). 【WIDE APPLICATION】Use white or colored sugar to produce beautiful and delicious clouds of cotton candy. It is the perfect snack for Birthday parties, social parties, children's holidays, and the first choice for cotton candy sellers or most parties. NOTE:We provide LIFELONG TECH SUPPORT, So welcome to consult us for any questions in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vW3YYuJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuilvu","source_asin":"B09D7TNXFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7TNXFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7TNXFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
