window.products.push({"id":828851,"name":"Dream Caused By The Flight Of A Bee by Dali","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Pr0NK2czL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The full title \"One second before awakening from a dream caused by the flight of a bee around a pomegranate\" explains how Dali was inspired by a dream that Gala reported to him. He saw the dream as an illustration of Freud's theory that dreams could be triggered by external stimuli. Gala, asleep and floating, feels the threat of the bee-sting, symbolized by the rifle with bayonet. The pomegranate, that probably attracted the bee, can be seen in the foreground and, in a huge version, on the left of the painting. It seems to be the source of the enormous fish with a snarling tiger leaping out of its mouth. In the background the elephant can be seen on long thin legs defying the laws of gravity, a recurring theme in Dali's works.   Material : Collectible quality, resin with hand-painted color details, matte and glossy finish. Statue replica is from the highly collectible Parastone Mouseion 3D Collection.   Included : Full color card with image of original artwork. Description card about artist and artwork. Both cards are in four languages.   Dimensions : 8.25 in. x 5.25 in. x 1.5 in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Pr0NK2czL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parastone","source_asin":"B007GWOH7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007GWOH7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007GWOH7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":828852,"name":"Emerald Home Furnishings T550-0 Simplicity Coffee Table, Standard, Walnut Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":132.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519qBA+VmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by Danish modern design, the Simplicity Collection from Emerald Home speaks to the shopper who finds beauty in clean lines and minimalist form. Someone who celebrates being different from the crowd. This collection is designed to fit your taste, your space, and your needs. Compromise on nothing and make the simple and stylish statement you've been searching for, with Simplicity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519qBA+VmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emerald Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B01NAV30HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAV30HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAV30HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":828853,"name":"Texan Inertia Nutcracker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-RXkKmJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The world's most popular cracker is back! This fun to use nutcracker was invented by Dr. Haywood Turner in Columbus Georgia. It derives it's distinctiveness from it's source of power and the results it achieves—it produces \"whole kernels\". Dr. Turner noticed that while his wife was cracking pecans there was a space between the shell and the nutmeat and if a quick impact could be provided the shell would shatter before reaching the meat. The means for providing the quick impact was decided upon to be common rubber bands producing kinetic energy (energy produced by motion) and the desired results of whole kernels was produced by a restriction in travel of the impact transmitted through a piston to the nut. The impact was contained by placing a heavy anvil on the other side of the nut. Since heavy means difficult to move because of inertia, hence, the name \"inertia nutcracker\". The cracker itself is classified as an impact type nutcracker. Cracks soft shell pecans with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-RXkKmJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Texan Nutsheller","source_asin":"B001NJ37LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001NJ37LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001NJ37LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
