window.products.push({"id":828935,"name":"1849 Map of Texas Old Texas Map, Texas, Map of Texas, Vintage Map, Restoration Decorator Style Texas Wall Art German Map of Texas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lUJESNNsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Karl Baedeker's map of Texas, published in 1849, and surmounted with a large Lone Star flag. In addition to being the earliest printed map to illustrate the Flag of Texas, it is also one of the only maps of Texas to highlight the State in its largest configuration, including its claims to neighboring parts of New Mexico and Colorado. Texas is still shown in its Republic configuration, incorporating Santa Fe, Taos and all of New Mexico east of the Rio Grande, as well as a portion of Colorado south of the Arkansas River. Texas would claim this expanded western boundary until the Compromise of 1850. As a result of the Compromise, Texas surrendered its claim to New Mexico, as well as its claims north of the Missouri Compromise Line. It retained the Texas Panhandle and the federal government agreed to pay the state's public debt. Texas antique map reproduction printed on museum grade quality, fine art paper. This historic map is expertly restored, eliminating distracting imperfections while preserving the minor flaws and marks that give these old charts character, while photographs and drawings are gently retouched and enhanced to look their best. ☑ PRINTED ON 175 GSM FINE ART PAPER. Museum-quality poster made on thick, durable, matte paper. ☑ MADE TO ORDER ESPECIALLY FOR YOU IN AMERICA. Shipped within 1-5 business days. The frame is not included. ☑ MORE ANTIQUE MAPS AVAILABLE. Check out our collection of unique vintage and antique maps","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lUJESNNsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vintago","source_asin":"B07VXWC2S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VXWC2S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VXWC2S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
