window.products.push({"id":828979,"name":"AMCOMFY Premuim Kitchen Anti Fatigue Mat,Comfort Floor Mats,Standing Desk Mats,Antique Series (24 x 70 x 3/4 Inches, Clover Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I8pB8ietL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARE YOU STILL SUFFERING FROM PAIN OFLONG TIME STANDING? Nowadays,many people have to stand for a long time in their daily life:A housewife who cook meals for all families,a office cherk who use standing desk for work;a teacher who stands a long time everyday;a choir diector when he is directing.....many of them suffer from pain in heels,foot arches,legs and back after a long time standing.But not any more now,our Amcomfy Anti-fatigue mat is for you! Stand Comfortable All Day Without Pain! HERE'RE REASONS WHY OUR MAT IS SO AMAZING! ▲ Beautifully Designed - With a special beautiful antique flower surface pattern design,the mat looks elegant and provides a warm accent for the home/kitchen/office/church.And it will complement and accentuate any room. ▲ Soft yet supportive - Etra 3/4\" thick,Amcomfy mat is very soft yet supportive to stand on.It's ergonomically emgineered,so the pressure from body weight will spread more evenly on the whole feet,instead of centering on the your heel and arch.It will instantly relief your pain and brings all day comfort once you step on this Amazing Mat! ▲ Safe to Use - Made with 100% premium Non-toxic materials.Beautiful flower textured surface and smooth beveled edges prevent slipping and tripping.Anti-Slip Bottom keeps the mat from moving out of place. ▲ User Friendly - You can easily adjust the mat position on various floor surface only with your feet while don't have to bend over to pick it up. ▲ Easy To Take Care - Durable,stain resistant and easy care.Simply wipe clean with a damp cloth or spray cleaner,any common household cleaner or sweep clean of dirt and dust. NOTE: The color of mats are slightly different,since it is 100% hand-made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I8pB8ietL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMCOMFY","source_asin":"B07D13X3SH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-828979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D13X3SH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D13X3SH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
